 another negative number $(-5).$ So the result will be positive:\n\n$$\n(-13)÷(-5)=\\boxed{}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $13$ by $5$ without any signs: $13÷5=\\frac{13}{5}.$ Therefore,  we get\n\n$$\n(-13)÷(-5)=\\frac{13}{5}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531618 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064358 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7de4234d-932f-537c-9eae-746e1711cccd" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Positive Number by a Negative Number"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c26020cd-5995-5bd2-a2b4-8eaebe5474f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531274}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c26020cd-5995-5bd2-a2b4-8eaebe5474f8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531274} :answer-field/id #uuid "2ebf7007-b58c-5e48-a18e-e666efc3182d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531423}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "89a1fe1c-2eda-5608-9d61-d01a69e48b0c" :question/math-academy-id "q-181155" :question/problem "$56÷(-8)=${{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We have to divide a positive number $(56)$ by a negative one $(-8).$ So the result will be negative:\n\n$$\n56÷(-8)=-\\boxed{}\n$$\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $56$ by $8$ without any signs: $56÷8=7.$ Therefore, we get\n\n$$\n56÷(-8)=-7.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531629 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186064358 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7de4234d-932f-537c-9eae-746e1711cccd" :knowledge-point/title "Dividing a Positive Number by a Negative Number"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cc44ad1b-e88c-5